  "body": "* 5 generously sized bedrooms, 4 bathrooms and a double garage\r\n* 364 sqm of floor area on a 424 sqm section\r\n* Double-height front lounge with an illuminated staircase\r\n* Architectural feature wall\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and family living with seamless access to the outdoor deck\r\n* Two kitchens with butler's pantry potential\r\n* Flexible ground-floor layout with a bedroom, a separate sitting room and granny potential\r\n* Upstairs lounge with a built-in bar and balcony overlooking green space\r\n* Master suite with an expansive walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite\r\n* Bathtubs in both the master ensuite and family bathroom\r\n* Central air conditioning and a central speaker system\r\n\r\nCombining architectural character with generous proportions and refined interior finishes, this impressive Long Bay residence offers 364 sqm of floor area across two levels, set on a 424 sqm section. With five generously sized bedrooms, four bathrooms and thoughtfully designed living spaces, the home delivers both contemporary luxury and exceptional flexibility for family living.\r\n\r\nTall windows fill the double-height front lounge with natural light, while an illuminated staircase and glass balustrades create a striking, gallery-like atmosphere. Further inside, an architectural feature wall with timber-toned detailing and illuminated display niches adds depth and character to the open-plan family living area.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the main kitchen features a striking veined waterfall island, complemented by generous cabinetry and bench space. Wide sliding doors connect the dining and family living areas directly to the outdoor deck, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nA ground-floor bedroom, a separate sitting room, a nearby bathroom and a second kitchen offer granny potential, providing flexibility for extended family living or accommodating guests. The second kitchen can also function as a spacious butler's pantry, ideal for everyday meal preparation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, an additional lounge features a built-in bar with a sink and illuminated glass cabinetry. Opening directly onto a balcony overlooking green space, this inviting retreat provides a relaxing setting for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms are positioned on the upper level, including an impressive master suite with an expansive walk-in wardrobe, illuminated cabinetry and a dedicated dressing area. The private ensuite features a freestanding bathtub, twin basins and a separate shower, while an additional bathtub in the family bathroom enhances everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nCentral air conditioning, a central speaker system and a double garage further complement this thoughtfully designed home.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Long Bay's coastal lifestyle, with Long Bay Village, cafés, restaurants, New World supermarket and everyday amenities close by. Long Bay Beach and Long Bay Regional Park offer beautiful natural surroundings and outdoor recreation, while convenient access to Albany and its wider transport connections adds to the appeal of this sought-after location.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson and Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home. For more information, visit www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
